{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01401","headline":"相和歌辞 祠渔山神女歌 送神 · 王维","name":"相和歌辞 祠渔山神女歌 送神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纷进舞兮堂前，目眷眷兮琼筵。\n来不言兮意不传，作暮雨兮愁空山。\n悲急管兮思繁弦，神之驾兮俨欲旋。\n倏云收兮雨歇，山青青兮水潺湲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}